[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3303.87, "timestamp": "00:55:03", "text": "是的。等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3306.87, "timestamp": "00:55:06", "text": "那么，该如何呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3309.75, "timestamp": "00:55:09", "text": "呃，你必须每月缴纳税款。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3312.23, "timestamp": "00:55:12", "text": "某物？不，你必须付钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3314.069, "timestamp": "00:55:14", "text": "每年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3315.91, "timestamp": "00:55:15", "text": "我的意思是，有很多方法可以支付。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3318.39, "timestamp": "00:55:18", "text": "就像有些人用硬币支付一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3321.91, "timestamp": "00:55:21", "text": "一年四次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3324.95, "timestamp": "00:55:24", "text": "据我所知。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3326.309, "timestamp": "00:55:26", "text": "我从未付过钱给他们。我刚刚问了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3327.91, "timestamp": "00:55:27", "text": "爸爸。我当时就想，“好吧，我需要付钱吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3329.349, "timestamp": "00:55:29", "text": "税收？”他回答说：“是啊。”我心想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3331.27, "timestamp": "00:55:31", "text": "“好的，我一共欠多少钱？”他就像是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3335.03, "timestamp": "00:55:35", "text": "“这么多。”我当时就想，“好吧，给你。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3338.47, "timestamp": "00:55:38", "text": "所以，他替我这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3340.15, "timestamp": "00:55:40", "text": "我的意思是，我现在不用交税了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3344.069, "timestamp": "00:55:44", "text": "因为 mtaji 呃提高了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3346.99, "timestamp": "00:55:46", "text": "东西。所以现在我不用付钱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3350.23, "timestamp": "00:55:50", "text": "因为瓶盖以前是两个或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3352.87, "timestamp": "00:55:52", "text": "三个左右"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3355.109, "timestamp": "00:55:55", "text": "但现在是12。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3357.589, "timestamp": "00:55:57", "text": "嗯。但我认为我爸爸还是得付钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3359.81, "timestamp": "00:55:59", "text": "它。我不知道。"}]